sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Quota as Quota Middleware
    participant ABAC as ABAC Engine
    participant Router as Routing Table
    participant Inline as Inline Provider<br/>(meta-reference)
    participant Remote as Remote Provider<br/>(vLLM/TGI/OpenAI)
    participant Tool as Tool Runtime<br/>(Tavily/MCP)
    participant KV as KV Store<br/>(SQLite/Postgres)
    participant JWKS as JWKS/Introspection<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,JWKS: Flow 1: Chat Completion Request

    Client->>Auth: POST /v1/inference/chat-completion<br/>Bearer token (optional)
    Auth->>JWKS: Validate JWT / Introspect token<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
    JWKS-->>Auth: Token claims + user attributes
    Auth->>Quota: Check rate limit
    Quota->>Router: Route to inference provider
    Router->>ABAC: Check resource access<br/>(permit/forbid rules)
    ABAC-->>Router: Access granted

    alt Inline Provider
        Router->>Inline: Inference request (in-process)
        Inline-->>Router: Completion result
    else Remote Provider
        Router->>Remote: Forward request<br/>HTTPS + API key
        Remote-->>Router: Completion result
    end

    Router-->>Client: JSON response<br/>(or SSE stream)

    Note over Client,JWKS: Flow 2: Agent Turn with Tool Use

    Client->>Auth: POST /v1/agents/{id}/session/{sid}/turn<br/>Bearer token
    Auth->>JWKS: Validate token<br/>HTTPS/443
    JWKS-->>Auth: Claims
    Auth->>Quota: Check rate limit
    Quota->>Router: Route to agent runtime

    loop Agent reasoning loop
        Router->>Remote: LLM inference call<br/>HTTPS + API key
        Remote-->>Router: Response with tool_calls
        Router->>Tool: Execute tool<br/>(e.g., Tavily search HTTPS/443)
        Tool-->>Router: Tool result
        Router->>KV: Persist session state
    end

    Router->>Remote: Final inference call
    Remote-->>Router: Final response
    Router-->>Client: SSE stream<br/>Agent turn events
